<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Contoh Visual — Peringkasan Tombol Produk (sementara)</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; font-family: "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif; background: #f4f1ea; color: #2b2b2b; padding: 28px; }
  h1 { font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 4px; }
  .sub { color: #8a8578; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .panel { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e7e1d3; border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.05); }
  .panel h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 3px; }
  .panel p { font-size: 12.5px; color: #8a8578; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .baris { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .judul-kecil { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #8a8578; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  /* --- tiruan tombol toolbar aplikasi --- */
  .grup-ikon { display: inline-flex; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ddd6c4; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; }
  .grup-ikon button { border: 0; background: #fff; font-size: 17px; padding: 9px 13px; cursor: default; border-right: 1px solid #eee7d5; color: #4a4a44; }
  .grup-ikon button:last-child { border-right: 0; }
  .tombol-primer { border: 0; background: #1e7a34; color: #fff; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 18px; cursor: default; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .tombol-aksi { border: 1px solid #ddd6c4; background: #fff; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 16px; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: #333; }
  .tombol-aksi:hover { background: #f7f4ec; }
  .menu-wrap { position: relative; display: inline-block; }
  .menu { position: absolute; top: calc(100% + 6px); left: 0; min-width: 230px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e0d9c6; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.13); padding: 6px; display: none; z-index: 10; }
  .menu.buka { display: block; }
  .menu button { display: flex; width: 100%; align-items: center; gap: 10px; border: 0; background: none; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 13.5px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; color: #333; text-align: left; }
  .menu button:hover { background: #f4f1ea; }
  .menu .ikon { width: 22px; text-align: center; }
  .menu .badge { margin-left: auto; background: #f0ebe0; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 11px; padding: 1px 9px; color: #6d6759; }
  .menu hr { border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee7d5; margin: 5px 4px; }
  .catatan { font-size: 12.5px; color: #6d6759; background: #faf8f2; border: 1px dashed #ddd6c4; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 14px; margin-top: 14px; }
  .opsi-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .opsi-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .opsi { border: 2px solid #e7e1d3; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; }
  .opsi.pilihan { border-color: #1e7a34; background: #f4faf5; }
  .opsi h3 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; }
  .opsi p { font-size: 12.5px; color: #6d6759; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; background: #1e7a34; color: #fff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 2px 10px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .tag.netral { background: #8a8578; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Contoh Visual — Peringkasan Tombol Halaman Produk</h1>
  <div class="sub">Mockup sementara (klik menu “Aksi” untuk membuka). Belum ada kode aplikasi yang diubah.</div>

  <div class="panel">
    <div class="judul-kecil">Kondisi sekarang</div>
    <h2>7 tombol di toolbar (yang dikeluhkan)</h2>
    <p>Enam tombol ikon + satu tombol hijau “+”. Sulit ditebak fungsinya tanpa tooltip.</p>
    <div class="baris">
      <span class="grup-ikon" aria-hidden="true">
        <button>⬇</button><button>🧾</button><button>📄</button><button>⬆</button><button>🖼</button><button>🗑</button>
      </span>
      <span class="tombol-primer">＋</span>
